# Credits

This plugin is built on the Omarchy shell plugin architecture: the
`manifest.json` contract, the bar-widget entry point, and the panel primitives
it composes (`KeyboardPanel`, `CursorSurface`, `PanelActionButton`,
`Commons.Translations`) all come from Omarchy, and its first-party bar widgets
were the reference for the idioms used here.

